abstract: "Peatland rewetting science: Guenther et al. 2020 (DOI 10.1038/s41467-020-15499-z; 2024 Author Correction DOI 10.1038/s41467-024-47604-x already applied) temperate CO2 sink and methane rise; Nationale Moorschutzstrategie DE 2022 (5 Mt CO2e/yr by 2030, ~53 Mt, ~7.5%); Kreyling et al. 2021 biodiversity honesty (no full restoration, no convergence over three decades). Unverified ~20 t CO2e/ha/yr figure intentionally omitted. Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge -- see DISCLAIMER.md. GenesisAeon P131. Own package, not a P100/P107 extension."
